User story

As a student or administrator, I want each test attempt's performance analytics recorded so that progress can be reviewed over time.

Acceptance criteria

- Analytics record accuracy, time per question, and category-wise performance for each attempt.

- Records can be queried by student and test.

- Analytics are associated with the correct attempt.

- The generated values are checked against known test data.

