[IPP-F-018] Student progress dashboard- Heemadhawala R

**Type: **Functional   **Priority: **High

User story

As a student, I want a dashboard showing my applications, scheduled interviews, and test scores so that I can track my placement preparation in one place.

Acceptance criteria

- The dashboard summarizes applications submitted, interviews scheduled, and test scores.

- Displayed figures match the underlying records for a seeded test account.

- Only the authenticated student can access their own dashboard data.

- Empty states are handled when the student has no activity.

