[IPP-F-019] Placement analytics dashboard - Joshwin paul 

**Type: **Functional   **Priority: **High

User story

As a placement officer, I want aggregate placement analytics so that I can understand placement rates, company-wise applications, and student performance trends.

Acceptance criteria

- The dashboard provides the specified aggregate metrics.

- Aggregated figures reconcile with the underlying application and test records.

- Access is restricted to authorized placement officers/admins.

- Analytics failures are reported clearly rather than showing misleading figures.

