[IPP-F-020] Visual charts for placement metrics - Kanishq Surendran 

**Type: **Functional   **Priority: **Medium

User story

As a placement officer, I want visual charts for key placement metrics across at least the last 12 months so that trends can be understood quickly.

Acceptance criteria

- The system provides appropriate bar, line, or pie charts for supported metrics.

- Charts support date ranges covering at least the last 12 months of data.

- Charts render correctly when data contains gaps and when no data exists.

- Chart labels and values correspond to the underlying metrics.

