**Type: **Functional   **Priority: **Medium

User story

As an authorized user, I want to export analytics as CSV or PDF so that I can share or review reports outside the portal.

Acceptance criteria

- Authorized users can request CSV or PDF exports for supported analytics.

- Exported records reflect the selected filters.

- CSV headers and PDF content are readable and accurate.

- Unauthorized users cannot export restricted analytics.

