[IPP-F-022]  Admin approval/rejection of recruiter accounts - Heemadhawala R

**Type: **Functional   **Priority: **High

User story

As an administrator, I want to approve or reject recruiter/company registrations so that only approved recruiters can publish internship listings.

Acceptance criteria

- An admin can approve or reject a recruiter registration.

- An unapproved recruiter cannot create or publish listings.

- Approval enables listing privileges according to the SRS.

- The approval outcome is stored and communicated where the workflow specifies.

